        "notes": "[Overstocked](item_d6b946fd-0fd8-4ba1-85d0-601995136eb6) gives us more Micro Missile charges. With where our ability power is at this point in the match, there are very few non tanks that are able to survive two barrages of Micro Missiles.\n\nSelling  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) usually allows you to pick  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) at this point but there are ways to mix and match commons to best fit our budget at this point. \n\n[Mastermind\u2019s Mitigator](item_ed05519f-24f7-456a-8a3a-cdc145a7250d) also deserves a shout for reducing your Missile cooldown but it is optional and matchup dependent.",
