        "created_at": "2025-07-28T21:40:18.092427+00:00",
        "notes": "[CounterMeasures](item_1a15e568-079c-4d1f-a7e5-37219bd9b87f) with our  [Legendary Loadout](item_81067d34-38fb-4057-9336-f387f75dfd5f) Missiles becomes a strong option at providing more damage during our Defense Matrix.\n\n[Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) with how strong our Missile damage is charges Ult very rapidly. My suggestion is to save your Ultimate to use as a second life remech as opposed to throwing Hail Mary DVa bombs. Mileage varies by  rank and bomb kills are way less frequent the more you climb rank.\n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is a great all around item that especially helps our survivability via lifesteal. Take as needed.\n\nI don't suggest it for every match but  [Nano Cola\u2122 Nitrous](item_9e63ff90-c7d7-4695-a6cb-575b2619a963) can be effective if you feel the need to get remech more consistently. However points are better spent elsewhere most of the time.",
